  "coordinator_reviewed": true,
  "scope": "Personal opening of all20 complete contact sheets covering168 unchanged original canvases, plus30 full primary original reopens. Actual mouse controls and orbit, no imported viewer model/code; cropped review sheets are uniform only. This is visual reference research, not an in-game or shader check.",
  "intermediate_blending_limitation": "At fixed mature age, all single later influences visibly change across25/50/75/100% requested handle fractions; compatible pair appearances look close to their pair endpoint by around50% on both handles. Both actual full endpoint handles were also captured and measured independently. This is a visual observation, not recovered source morph formulas or source-game stat calibration. A common fresh target and bilinear mature grid are project approximations. Source age0 frames look very similar but fixed crop RGB hashes are not identical, so exact image/geometry equivalence is not asserted.",
  "shape_findings": {
    "fresh": "Distinct Swim-first pair of white-root draping mint-tipped crown flaps, mint torso/mitts/feet, yellow halo, blue/cream small rear wings.",
    "balanced": "Short outward/down white/yellow/teal flaps and blue halo at mature age.",
    "run": "Longer narrow flaps descend down/forward near cheek/eye-bottom in face-right side view; mint/cyan/blue tips, blue torso, lime-yellow halo.",
    "power": "Broad upright/outward white/mint/gold paired paddles, up/back sweep in side view, gold hands and orange/gold halo.",
    "fly": "White/lime broad arch with green upturned terminal fins, up/back in side view; emerald torso, yellow halo and gold/cream winglets.",
    "swim": "Very long white/mint/cyan/violet streamers descend down/back beyond chin/neck; violet torso/halo, cream/darkteal wing fins.",
    "run-fly": "Short outward/down arch with small teal upturned terminal nib; yellow halo, aqua torso and lime accents.",
    "run-swim": "Long nearly vertical side flaps with cyan/blue tips; pale gray/mint halo, blue/periwinkle torso.",
    "power-fly": "Broad near-horizontal paddles with slightly raised outercorners; lime accents, gold halo, pale green/cream winglets.",
    "power-swim": "Medium-long shallow outward/down flaps and rear/down side sweep, beige/tan tips; dusty pink halo, slate torso and tan hands/toes.",
    "white_regions": "All observed forms retain white skull/face, belly center, foot heels and tiny central tail; colored torso/back, hand ends and crown accents are distinct regions.",
    "source_head": "Source skull taper/proportion changes are reference only; project must retain fixed original head box and author separate blocky features.",
    "wings": "Small paired lobed wing/fins are inspected from side/back and above/below; simplify smooth edges and zigzags to a small number of solid boxes/pixel regions.",
    "opposition": "Swim first checkbox stays selected in actual viewer while later SF crosses to Fly; distinct Fly and pair appearances remain Hero/Swim first type. No reverse pair duplicates."
  }
